 drivers/clk/hisilicon/Makefile            |   1 +
 drivers/clk/hisilicon/clk-ascend310-cpu.c | 200 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 209 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/hisilicon/clk-ascend310-cpu.c

